  <metadata>
    <name>Vejle: Fjorden, Munkebjerg og Kiddesvej</name>
    <desc>A loop from Vejle station along the south shore of Vejle Fjord, up Munkebjerg, over the plateau and back into town by way of Kiddesvej. Roads from OpenStreetMap, routed with BRouter; heights from EU-DEM v1.1 (25 m), with the shoreline points EU-DEM leaves empty taken from SRTM.</desc>
